WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:18.965
Hello!

2
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.750
Who are you?

3
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.310
I'm a humpback whale.

4
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.570
We are large sea mammals.

5
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:35.838
Where do you live?

6
00:00:35.839 --> 00:00:40.405
Humpback whales live in the ocean.

7
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:45.350
We travel very far every year.

8
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.879
Where do you travel?

9
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:53.420
We live in cold water in the summer.

10
00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.360
We swim to warm water for the winter.

11
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:03.659
What do you eat?

12
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.500
We eat small sea creatures and fish.

13
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.720
Humpback whales are good hunters.

14
00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:32.649
I hear a song!

15
00:01:32.649 --> 00:01:37.642
Humpback whales make lots of sounds.

16
00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.620
Males even sing songs.

17
00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:47.270
Sometimes they sing for hours.

18
00:01:52.342 --> 00:01:55.729
Is that a hump on your back?

19
00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.860
No. That's my back fin.

20
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.000
It's small and looks like a hump.

21
00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:12.410
You have a big tail!

22
00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.750
Our tails help us jump out of the water.

23
00:02:16.816 --> 00:02:23.201
Humpback whales love to splash.

24
00:02:23.201 --> 00:02:33.393
Watch this. Splash!

25
00:02:33.393 --> 00:02:36.689
Good-bye!

26
00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:42.330
Good-bye, Humpback Whale!
